a-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">Baggage Upgrade<!----><!----><!----></div></div><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-1-2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-posinset=\"3\" aria-setsize=\"3\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-1-2\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">Notes<!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----></div><mat-ink-bar class=\"mat-ink-bar\"></mat-ink-bar></div></div><button aria-hidden=\"false\" type=\"button\" mat-ripple=\"\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-header-pagination mat-tab-header-pagination-after mat-elevation-z4 mat-tab-header-pagination-disabled\" disabled=\"\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next slide\"><div class=\"mat-tab-header-pagination-chevron\"></div></button></mat-tab-header><div class=\"mat-tab-body-wrapper\"><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-29 mat-tab-body-active ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-1-0\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-1-0\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-29 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----><div class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"> <p>\n    Now you can purchase additional baggage for your trip for certain destinations through our \"Saudia\" website and Mobile application and get a discounted rate up to 30%.\n  </p>\n\n  <p>Simply, retrieve an existing booking and purchase additional baggages.</p>\n\n  <p>\n    In case of purchasing an additional baggage, a voucher will be issued for each additional bag noting the following will apply:\n  </p>\n\n<ul>\n    <li>The validity of the voucher is for one year from the date of issuance</li>\n    <li>Extra baggage vouchers refund, re-issuance, changing flight time, and re-routing are not allowed.</li>\n    <li>In the event of no show, the guest will lose full value of the extra baggage voucher.</li>\n    <li>\n      This service is available for certain destinations and sectors and may not be available for online pre-purchase due to operational limitations. In this case, you can pay for excess baggage at the airport.\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <p>\n    Note: Do not place valuables and important documents in your luggage which will be shipped in aircraft storage.\n  </p></span><!----></p><!----></div><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-30 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-1-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-1-1\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-30 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-31 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-1-2\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-1-2\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-31 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><!----></div></mat-tab-group><!----></div></app-jss-tabs><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutali